{"id":"vod_lz_11523","vodId":"11523","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"在魔王城说晚安","name_cn":"在魔王城说晚安","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220427-1/f28718fc5c9b665fb68cd25a8cbf5262.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个人类与魔族共存的世界，但是世界的支配权还是掌握在人类的受众。一天，魔王抓走并囚禁了人类公主栖夜莉丝（水濑祈 配音），并且向人类发出了勒索信，要求人类用世界的支配权来换回公主的自由。为了拯救公主，勇者拂晓（下野纮 配音）踏上了充满了危机的旅途。                                                                     　　然而，被囚禁的日子实在是太过于无聊了，古灵精怪又闲不住的栖夜莉丝决定在魔王城里找点乐子。无论是恶魔教会的法师雷欧纳多（石川界人 配音）还是世代侍奉魔王的忠犬哈士奇（小林亲弘 配音），甚至连威风凛凛的魔王（松冈祯丞 配音）本人，都被公主的恶作剧给耍得团团转。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-27 19:28:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12794_10c932e4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12798_076b9b20/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12800_b8880d56/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12797_5d7f314c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12801_9495a09c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12802_a1dab10d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12799_36e708f6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12806_bd4cddc4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12805_09429a86/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12804_1a7b0f14/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12803_d6137f86/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220427/12808_5fb22467/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:38.962Z"}